      "source": "Create a new DelegatingDataSource.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 DelegatingDataSource。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "This class is meant to be subclassed, with subclasses overriding only\nthose methods (such as <a href=\"#getConnection()\"><code>getConnection()</code></a>) that should not simply\ndelegate to the target DataSource.",
      "translation": "该类旨在被继承，子类仅应重写那些不应简单地委派给目标 DataSource 的方法（例如<a href=\"#getConnection()\"><code>getConnection()</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the target <code>DataSource</code> for actual use (never <code>null</code>).",
      "translation": "获取实际使用的目标<code>DataSource</code>(永远不为<code>null</code>)。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the target DataSource that this DataSource should delegate to.",
      "translation": "返回此 DataSource 应委托的目标 DataSource。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the target DataSource that this DataSource should delegate to.",
      "translation": "设置此 DataSource 应委托的目标 DataSource。",
      "count": 2
